# Core

Applies to this project.

## Git
- Never `git commit`, `git push`, amend, or stage-and-commit.
- Leave changes uncommitted; **Paul commits**.
- Bots and Cursor agents do not commit or push.

## Contact & chrome
- No contact page. No “Contact” in nav or footer.
- No email addresses or `mailto:` links in the product.
- Privacy (and About, when it exists) live in the **footer** only.

## Docs
- Read `docs/` and relevant `.cursor` briefs/plans before building.
- Do not invent product or design decisions; flag open questions.

## Language
- Public chrome and SEO copy: **English only**.
- No i18n / hreflang unless Paul asks.
